==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Hylian Shroom}}
In {{BotW}}, Hylian Shrooms are common [[Material]]s found near [[Tree]]s in [[Hyrule]]. [[Link]] can eat one to restore half a [[Heart]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can be cooked into [[Toasty Hylian Shroom|Toasty Hylian Shrooms]], which heal three-quarters of a Heart.<ref name="BotW Inventory 2"/> At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], they are also used to create Red [[Dye]].

